{"id":"7232dda6455e1c93","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md","title":"Representation Theorem for Recursive Sets","display":"thm-recursive-set-representation — Representation Theorem for Recursive Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-recursive-set-representation","aliases":["90-thm-recursive-set-representation"],"display":"thm-recursive-set-representation — Representation Theorem for Recursive Sets","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-representability-theorem]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-recursive-set-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-recursive-set-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursive-set-representation — Representation Theorem for Recursive Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的固定规则；证明码与实际推导的对应见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> (fixed effective arithmetical signature and syntax encoding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> (extension of Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> (effective axiomatizability, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (unary relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span> (recursive unary predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_T\\)</span> (strong numeralwise relation-representability predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set\\text{-}representation}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\n\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nX\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(X,\\varphi)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set\\text{-}representation}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\n\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nX\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(X,\\varphi)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 递归，由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a> 取得算术公式，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=v\">\\(v=v\\)</span> 合取使指定自由变量确实出现。反向给定逐数表示公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 时交错枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的有限证明，直到发现结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\">\\(\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\)</span> 或其否定；前者输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，后者输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。有效公理化及证明码的对应使这一枚举有效；表示性保证至少一种证明出现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> 保证演算一致，因而不会两种都出现。所得全递归函数正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的特征函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>从左到右可取相应的算术表示公式；从右到左利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的有效公理化、一致性以及正负数码实例均可证，交错枚举两类证明即可判定成员关系。</li>\n<li>决定定理真值的三个条件现已进入断言，而不是仅写在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的自然语言类型说明中。</li>\n<li>集合应使用关系表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\\)</span> 在上游专用于全函数的图像及内部唯一性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"